## Details

<!-- Fixes Introduced In / CVE Identifiers come straight from the iHealth API
     (fixedInVersions.version, results.h_cve_ids). Article Links / Related
     Changes are both derived from results.solution, split by id prefix
     ("K..." = KB article, anything else = related change ID) -- this repo
     hasn't seen a CVE-flagged finding live yet to confirm that split, so
     treat "Related Changes" as best-effort until validated against one. -->
{% for d in diagnostics_sorted %}
{% set solution = d.results.solution | default([]) -%}
{% set fixed_in = d.fixedInVersions.version | default([]) if d.fixedInVersions is defined else [] -%}
{% set cve_ids = d.results.h_cve_ids -%}
{% set d_cves = (cve_ids if cve_ids is not string else [cve_ids]) if cve_ids else [] -%}
{% set matches = tenable_findings | selectattr('plugin.cve', 'defined') | list -%}
{% set matched = [] -%}
{% for v in matches -%}
{% set v_cves = v.plugin.cve | default([]) -%}
{% set v_cves = [v_cves] if v_cves is string else v_cves -%}
{% if d_cves | select('in', v_cves) | list | length > 0 -%}
{% set _ = matched.append(v) -%}
{% endif -%}
{% endfor -%}
<details id="finding-{{ d.name | lower }}">
<summary>{{ d.name }} — {{ clean(d.results.h_header) }}</summary>

- **Fixes Introduced In:** {{ fixed_in | join(', ') if fixed_in | length > 0 else '—' }}
- **CVE Identifiers:** {{ (cve_ids if cve_ids is string else cve_ids | join(', ')) if cve_ids else '—' }}
- **Article Links:** {{ links_list(solution) }}
- **Related Changes:** {{ ids_list(solution) }}
{% if tenable_findings | length > 0 -%}
{% if matched | length > 0 -%}
- **Tenable One:** Plugin {{ matched[0].plugin.id | default('—') }}, VPR {{ matched[0].plugin.vpr.score | default('—') }}, CVSSv3 {{ matched[0].plugin.cvss3_base_score | default('—') }}, state {{ matched[0].state | default('—') }} — confirmed via network scan
{% else -%}
- **Tenable One:** Not observed in this scan (iHealth-only, config-review advisory)
{% endif -%}
{% endif -%}
</details>
{% endfor %}
